WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.233 --> 00:00:06.900
Dendemille Town and Anistar City are our heroes' next destinations,

2
00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:10.766
and the Gym Battle for Ash's seventh Kalos Badge awaits.

3
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:13.233
- Good?
- Braix.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.333
- Can I brush Braixen too?
- Of course.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.833
Yippee-yay.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.333
Ne! Denne-denne-denne!

7
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.800
Chespin! Chespin!

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.833
Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!

9
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.833
Lu.

10
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.033
Cha.

11
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.900
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

12
00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:52.666
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

13
00:00:52.733 --> 00:00:56.100
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

14
00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:57.566
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

15
00:00:57.633 --> 00:01:01.466
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

16
00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:04.733
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

17
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.166
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

18
00:01:08.233 --> 00:01:12.133
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

19
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:16.833
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

20
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.100
♪ Pokémon! ♪

21
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:25.933
A Not-So-Flying Start!

22
00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.633
- Let's get going.
- Sure.

23
00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:35.566
Luxray and Bunnelby, return.

24
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.533
Return.

25
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.700
-Hm!

26
00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:45.700
Fletch.

27
00:01:45.766 --> 00:01:47.366
- Where's Hawlucha?
- Pika.

28
00:01:47.433 --> 00:01:50.866
It's been a while since I've seen it.

29
00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:53.200
- Pi, pika.
- Huh!

30
00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:55.200
Right. Hey, Hawlucha.

31
00:01:55.266 --> 00:01:58.266
-Lucha!

32
00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.400
Whoa, what's that?

33
00:02:01.466 --> 00:02:04.366
- Pika.
- Hawlucha.

34
00:02:04.433 --> 00:02:06.766
-Is this what I think it is?

35
00:02:06.833 --> 00:02:08.366
A Pokémon egg.

36
00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:12.366
- Yeah? A Pokémon egg?
- Ah, I've never seen one before.

37
00:02:12.433 --> 00:02:14.600
So what kind of Pokémon egg is it?

38
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:17.400
You can't tell just by looking at it.

39
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:19.633
Hawlucha, where did you get this egg?

40
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.033
Cha-lu.

41
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.100
Lu, ha-cha.

42
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:26.600
- You found it here?
- Cha.

43
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:30.100
- Maybe we can find the nest. Huh?
- Pika?

44
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.100
- Wow, it's glowing.
- Pika, Pikachu!

45
00:02:33.166 --> 00:02:35.266
- It might be close to hatching.
- Huh!

46
00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:37.666
- What should I do?
- Pika!

47
00:02:37.733 --> 00:02:40.066
-It's gonna hatch!

48
00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.433
Ash? I think you're supposed to keep it warm.

49
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.766
Right. Just leave it to me.

50
00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:46.600
- Hm.
- Pi. Pikachu.

51
00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.666
Cha! Haw!

52
00:02:49.533 --> 00:02:50.966
- Ha.
- Chespin!

53
00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:53.600
- Yay. I'll help you keep it warm too.
- Bonnie.

54
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:57.033
Calm down. You've got to be very careful with that egg.

55
00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.666
- I know, I know.
- Ne.

56
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.666
Ne! Denne-nenne!

57
00:03:02.733 --> 00:03:04.333
Fletchinder. Fle, fletch.

58
00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.966
You too? Wow, that's really very nice of you, Fletchinder.

59
00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:12.366
- Fletch. Fletchinder.
- Things are looking really good.

60
00:03:12.433 --> 00:03:15.266
I can't wait for it to hatch.

61
00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:17.600
-Pika!

62
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:18.900
Denne-ne!

63
00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:23.400
- Denne-ne!
- Huh?

64
00:03:23.466 --> 00:03:26.566
- Look at that.
- It's moving, it's moving.

65
00:03:26.633 --> 00:03:29.100
- Won't be long.
- You can do it.

66
00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:33.000
- Denne!
- Fletchinder!

67
00:03:36.233 --> 00:03:38.066
Aaah!

68
00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.833
- It hatched.
- That's amazing.

69
00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.466
Pika!

70
00:03:44.533 --> 00:03:47.666
- Lucha.
- What is it?

71
00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:51.600
Noibat. The Sound Wave Pokémon.

72
00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:55.966
Noibat can cause damage as well as create hearing problems for its opponents

73
00:03:56.033 --> 00:03:59.000
by emitting different sound wave frequencies.

74
00:03:59.066 --> 00:04:02.666
- How about that? A Noibat.
- Cutie!

75
00:04:02.733 --> 00:04:05.000
Wow, a Noibat.

76
00:04:09.733 --> 00:04:12.333
-It opened its eyes.

77
00:04:19.166 --> 00:04:22.333
- Hi.
- Pika, pika!

78
00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.633
Noi.

79
00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:28.500
- My name's Ash. This is Pikachu.
- Pika, Pikachu.

80
00:04:28.566 --> 00:04:31.066
- Heh, I'm Clemont.
- I'm Serena.

81
00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:35.500
- My name's Bonnie. And this is Dedenne.
- Denne-ne.

82
00:04:35.566 --> 00:04:38.800
- Ha! Hawlucha!
- Chespin! Chespin! Che...

83
00:04:38.866 --> 00:04:42.000
- Pancham, cham!
- Fletch!

84
00:04:42.066 --> 00:04:45.400
Fletchinder helped a lot by warming up the egg like that.

85
00:04:45.466 --> 00:04:46.433
How do you mean?

86
00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.800
Fletchinder has an ability called Flame Body

87
00:04:48.866 --> 00:04:51.733
that can actually help Pokémon eggs hatch a lot quicker.

88
00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:52.933
Ah!

89
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.933
- Thanks, Fletchinder. You were great.
- Fletchinder.

90
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.100
Noi. Noi.

91
00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:02.000
Noi, noi, noi... noi, noi...

92
00:05:02.066 --> 00:05:04.000
Noibat!

93
00:05:05.433 --> 00:05:07.433
That's Noibat's Supersonic.

94
00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.500
Noibat, it's all right.

95
00:05:13.566 --> 00:05:15.500
-Noibat!

96
00:05:15.566 --> 00:05:20.500
- You don't have to cry. Everything's fine.
- Noi, noi...

97
00:05:20.566 --> 00:05:24.366
- Huh? Hey, it stopped.
- Do you think petting it helped?

98
00:05:24.433 --> 00:05:27.733
- I'm not sure.
- I'll bet you're hungry, right?

99
00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.966
- Bat, bat, bat, noi.
- Hm.

100
00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:32.666
Its favourite foods are right here. It says berries.

101
00:05:32.733 --> 00:05:34.800
Berries, huh?

102
00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.733
- What do you think?
- Looks good to me.

103
00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.500
- Dedenne, would you pick one?
- Denne.

104
00:05:41.566 --> 00:05:44.733
Nenne-ne! Ne-ne-ne-ne!

105
00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.633
Ne-ne-ne. Nenne-ne!

106
00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.700
Denne!

107
00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.633
OK, here you are.

108
00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.633
- Bat!

109
00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.633
- Noi, noi, noi, noi!
- Huh?

110
00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:01.433
But don't you want it? Maybe you don't like berries that much.

111
00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.300
- But that can't be true.
- Look. Yummy berry.

112
00:06:05.366 --> 00:06:07.266
Yuck. That's sour.

113
00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:11.400
It says right here that Noibat can tell how ripe a berry is with sound waves.

114
00:06:11.466 --> 00:06:15.466
- Wow, you can do that, Noibat?
- So, it's a foodie.

115
00:06:15.533 --> 00:06:18.400
Noi, Noibat.

116
00:06:18.466 --> 00:06:19.766
- Ha!
- Fletch!

117
00:06:19.833 --> 00:06:21.766
- Pan.
- Pin, pin, Chespin.

118
00:06:27.466 --> 00:06:30.033
- Che, che, Chespin.
- Noi. Noibat, bat.

119
00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:33.400
- Cha?
- Noi, Noibat, bat.

120
00:06:33.466 --> 00:06:35.433
Noi. Noibat, bat, bat, bat.

121
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:38.900
- Guess they're sour.
- So it doesn't like any of these.

122
00:06:40.766 --> 00:06:43.166
Bat.

123
00:06:44.366 --> 00:06:46.600
Bat! Noi, noi! Noi!

124
00:06:46.666 --> 00:06:49.000
- Huh? This?
- Noi, Noibat. Bat!

125
00:06:49.066 --> 00:06:50.766
Here you go.

126
00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:54.166
Noi! Mm, mm. Noibat!

127
00:06:54.233 --> 00:06:58.766
Mm, it's really sweet. -Let's see.

128
00:06:58.833 --> 00:06:59.900
Tastes great.

129
00:06:59.966 --> 00:07:01.600
Chespin, che.

130
00:07:01.666 --> 00:07:04.466
- Che... spin!
- Huh?

131
00:07:04.533 --> 00:07:06.466
- Che, Chespin, che!
- Sour, huh?

132
00:07:06.533 --> 00:07:10.133
- Noibat can really pick out the ripe ones.
- Chespin. Che.

133
00:07:11.433 --> 00:07:15.800
- Don't spill it, 'kay?
- Noi... noi... noi... noi...

134
00:07:15.866 --> 00:07:17.200
Noibat!

135
00:07:17.266 --> 00:07:19.766
- That should do it.
- Noi.

136
00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:21.700
Huh? Where are you going?

137
00:07:21.766 --> 00:07:24.700
Noi. Noi. Noi! Noi!

138
00:07:24.766 --> 00:07:26.833
- I think it's trying to fly.
- Noibat, bat, bat.

139
00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.066
-Noi, noi, noi, noi, noi...

140
00:07:31.766 --> 00:07:33.100
-Uh-oh.

141
00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:35.600
Bat!

142
00:07:35.666 --> 00:07:37.833
-Noibat! Bat!

143
00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.100
You're OK. Did that hurt?

144
00:07:40.166 --> 00:07:42.066
-It stopped.

145
00:07:42.133 --> 00:07:45.100
Maybe it thinks Ash is its caregiver.

146
00:07:45.166 --> 00:07:47.600
Now, let's try it once more.

147
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:49.833
Noi, noi, Noibat.

148
00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:53.266
- Way to go, Noibat.
- You can do it.

149
00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.300
Bat, bat, bat, bat, noi, noi-noi-noi! Noi, noi, noi!

150
00:07:58.866 --> 00:08:02.366
- Uh! There. I've got you.
- Noi, noi, noi, Noibat.

151
00:08:04.233 --> 00:08:06.900
Maybe it can't fly because it's so little.

152
00:08:06.966 --> 00:08:10.266
They're supposed to be able to fly as soon as they hatch.

153
00:08:10.333 --> 00:08:12.200
I'll bet there's a trick to flying.

154
00:08:12.266 --> 00:08:16.700
Just like knowing the trick to riding a bicycle.

155
00:08:16.766 --> 00:08:22.133
- A Noibat that can't fly is useless.
- Hm. Here it is.

156
00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:25.566
It evolves into a Noivern. And that's useful.

157
00:08:25.633 --> 00:08:28.300
Noivern? That is useful.

158
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:31.366
I can see it now. Our newest Team Rocket member.

159
00:08:31.433 --> 00:08:33.299
Waste not, want not.

160
00:08:33.366 --> 00:08:38.700
Listen up. The plan is to catch Noibat and force it to evolve into Noivern, right?

161
00:08:38.766 --> 00:08:40.299
Yes, ma'am.

162
00:08:42.466 --> 00:08:45.766
Ready, Noibat? Time to fly.

163
00:08:45.833 --> 00:08:48.300
Pikachu.

164
00:08:48.366 --> 00:08:51.633
- Cha! Lucha!
- Fletchinder. Fletchinder!

165
00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:53.733
-Fletch! Fletch!

166
00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.300
Bat, bat, bat.

167
00:08:55.366 --> 00:08:58.166
Yeah. You teaching Noibat is a great idea.

168
00:08:58.233 --> 00:09:00.733
Of course. You'll be great examples.

169
00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.633
Bat, bat, bat. Noi, noi, Noibat, Noibat.

170
00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.733
Pika, pika!

171
00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.900
Noibat, bat, bat, bat, bat!

172
00:09:06.966 --> 00:09:08.300
- Fletchinder!
- Noi, noi, Noibat!

173
00:09:10.033 --> 00:09:11.900
- Pika.
- Fletch.

174
00:09:11.966 --> 00:09:15.966
- Uh, what's it doing wrong, Fletchinder?
- Fletchinder.

175
00:09:16.033 --> 00:09:19.000
Hey, Ash? Maybe Noibat should start out by learning

176
00:09:19.066 --> 00:09:22.966
- how to glide on the currents of the wind.
- Wow, that would work great.

177
00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:28.300
- Yeah, Hawlucha, would you teach it how?
- Hawlucha, cha.

178
00:09:28.366 --> 00:09:30.800
Ha!

179
00:09:31.566 --> 00:09:35.033
Lu. Hawlucha!

180
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.233
Noibat!

181
00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.866
- Cha!
- Noibat!

182
00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.666
- You're doing great.
- Good job.

183
00:09:48.733 --> 00:09:50.733
- Bat, bat, bat, bat, bat!
- Ha? Ha?

184
00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.666
Pika, pika!

185
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
- Noi!
- Lu! Cha!

186
00:09:57.066 --> 00:10:00.033
- Pikachu!
- Thanks a lot, Hawlucha.

187
00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.366
Noi.

188
00:10:01.433 --> 00:10:03.633
- Noibat.
- Hm.

189
00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.366
- Flying's not easy, huh?
- Pikachu.

190
00:10:06.433 --> 00:10:09.133
Hawlucha, do you have any other ideas?

191
00:10:09.766 --> 00:10:11.333
Ha...

192
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.766
Cha!

193
00:10:15.533 --> 00:10:17.633
This is a stroke of genius.

194
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.066
There's a constant wind blowing way up here,

195
00:10:20.133 --> 00:10:23.133
so it's the perfect place to practise riding the currents.

196
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.133
Ha... cha!

197
00:10:27.366 --> 00:10:29.966
Ha-cha! Hawlucha!

198
00:10:30.033 --> 00:10:32.533
Ready, Noibat? Let's give it a shot.

199
00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.066
- Pika, pika.
- You can do it.

200
00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:35.800
- Fletchinder.
- Noibat!

201
00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.133
Bat!

202
00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.133
Fletchinder!

203
00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.166
- You're flying.
- Looking good.

204
00:10:47.233 --> 00:10:49.833
- Keep it up.

205
00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.033
Hawlucha!

206
00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.533
I know that balloon.

207
00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.233
Prepare for trouble, this balloon knows you too!

208
00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.533
And make it double, it's silly but true!

209
00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.100
To protect the world from devastation!

210
00:11:02.166 --> 00:11:04.833
To unite all people within our nation!

211
00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:07.833
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

212
00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.600
We reached down low and grabbed from above!

213
00:11:10.666 --> 00:11:13.166
- Jessie.
- And James.

214
00:11:13.233 --> 00:11:16.500
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

215
00:11:16.566 --> 00:11:19.533
Surrender now or prepare for one flighty fight!

216
00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.000
Meowth, that's right!

217
00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:26.533
Giving up this Noibat will make it much easier on you.

218
00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.033
After all, being a twerp is hard enough.

219
00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.000
We're happy to lighten your load.

220
00:11:31.066 --> 00:11:34.433
- Give 'em both back.
- Noibat's still a little Pokémon.

221
00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.000
- Pika!
- You're little too. No excuses.

222
00:11:37.066 --> 00:11:40.833
We'll treat that little tyke like nothing less than precious Pokémon gold,

223
00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:44.033
and very soon, it will evolve into a nifty Noivern.

224
00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:47.466
Get back here. Fletchinder. Steel Wing, let's go.

225
00:11:47.533 --> 00:11:50.600
Fletchinder! Fletchinder!

226
00:11:53.166 --> 00:11:54.866
OK, Inkay, out.

227
00:11:54.933 --> 00:11:56.966
Inkay!

228
00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:59.500
Fletchinder!

229
00:11:59.566 --> 00:12:02.066
Fletchinder!

230
00:12:02.133 --> 00:12:04.133
-Fletch!

231
00:12:05.866 --> 00:12:07.666
Here, curveball.

232
00:12:14.666 --> 00:12:17.100
That Team Rocket...

233
00:12:17.166 --> 00:12:19.800
Who's that Pokémon?

234
00:12:24.166 --> 00:12:26.700
It's Altaria!

235
00:12:26.766 --> 00:12:29.033
Altaria!

236
00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:33.100
Fletchinder. Fletch.

237
00:12:33.166 --> 00:12:35.266
Fletch.

238
00:12:35.333 --> 00:12:37.600
- Fletchinder!
- Better, huh?

239
00:12:37.666 --> 00:12:39.666
Fletchinder! Fletch! Fletch! Fletchinder!

240
00:12:39.733 --> 00:12:43.033
- Thank goodness.
- Now, go!

241
00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.566
Fletchinder!

242
00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.966
Relax. No sense getting into a tizzy.

243
00:12:52.033 --> 00:12:54.400
Noibat!

244
00:12:54.466 --> 00:12:55.866
-Noi?

245
00:12:55.933 --> 00:12:58.400
Screech all you want, cos we can't hear you!

246
00:12:58.466 --> 00:13:00.100
Your Supersonic's a dud.

247
00:13:00.166 --> 00:13:02.433
With protective headphones, that is.

248
00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:06.133
You see, three pairs of screechless ears are happy ears.

249
00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.166
But we can still hear each other's words of wisdom.

250
00:13:09.233 --> 00:13:10.166
Mm-hm.

251
00:13:10.233 --> 00:13:12.100
It's state-of-the-art Team Rocket tech.

252
00:13:12.166 --> 00:13:14.300
Chalu, ha-hacha.

253
00:13:14.366 --> 00:13:17.400
Noi! Noibat, bat, bat, bat!

254
00:13:17.466 --> 00:13:18.900
Noi, noi, noi, noi. Bat, bat, bat!

255
00:13:18.966 --> 00:13:22.333
If you don't learn to fly, we'll have to give you the boot.

256
00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.566
- Chalu.
- Huh? Oh.

257
00:13:24.666 --> 00:13:28.300
Ha! Argh! Hawlucha, cha!

258
00:13:28.366 --> 00:13:31.100
Featherbrain can't fly either.

259
00:13:31.166 --> 00:13:35.600
- I thought it was supposed to be smart.
- We saw you soar so don't be a bore.

260
00:13:35.666 --> 00:13:38.600
- Cha-lu-ha.
- Noi.

261
00:13:38.666 --> 00:13:41.366
How are we gonna make Noibat evolve already?

262
00:13:41.433 --> 00:13:44.933
Hold. Looking for ways to make a Noibat evolve.

263
00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:49.600
Isn't there some way to get this evolutionary show on the road immediately?

264
00:13:49.666 --> 00:13:53.833
We don't need to use a stone or wait for a certain time to make it evolve, right?

265
00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.366
Tell me it's not one of those annoying Pokémon.

266
00:13:56.433 --> 00:13:58.900
Maybe we can just turn it upside down.

267
00:13:58.966 --> 00:14:01.200
Inkay, ink.

268
00:14:01.266 --> 00:14:03.933
- Well?
- Found it.

269
00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.633
It says, raise it.

270
00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.633
- That's work.
- Mm-hm. That's part of the fun, hm.

271
00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:16.000
- Take you. I've raised you well.
- Noibat's not worth it.

272
00:14:16.066 --> 00:14:18.700
Just where do you two think you're going?

273
00:14:18.766 --> 00:14:21.233
- Go, Inkay!
- Ink!

274
00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:24.300
- Cha-ha!
- Inkay!

275
00:14:26.766 --> 00:14:29.700
Ha. Hawlucha!

276
00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.166
- Noibat! Bat!
- Ha!

277
00:14:34.233 --> 00:14:36.866
Noi! Bat, bat, bat, bat!

278
00:14:36.933 --> 00:14:38.300
- Lucha!
- Noi!

279
00:14:38.366 --> 00:14:39.366
- Hawlu!
- Noi!

280
00:14:39.433 --> 00:14:42.333
Argh! OK, Pumpkaboo, fetch.

281
00:14:44.333 --> 00:14:45.366
Pumpkaboo.

282
00:14:45.433 --> 00:14:47.300
You get in there as well, Inkay.

283
00:14:47.366 --> 00:14:49.066
Ink, Inkay.

284
00:14:49.133 --> 00:14:53.166
Bad, bad Hawlucha. You're going to pay for this.

285
00:14:53.233 --> 00:14:56.800
- No more nice guys.
- Nasty always wins.

286
00:14:58.333 --> 00:15:01.400
- Ha!
- Ka-ka-ka-kaboo!

287
00:15:01.466 --> 00:15:03.233
Ha!

288
00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.233
Kay.

289
00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.433
- Inkay!
- Lucha!

290
00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:11.433
- Cha-ha!
- Bat. Noi! Noibat!

291
00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.300
- Ha, cha!
- Kay!

292
00:15:14.366 --> 00:15:16.366
Pumpkaboo!

293
00:15:16.433 --> 00:15:18.200
- Noibat!
- Ha-ha!

294
00:15:20.133 --> 00:15:21.866
- Inkay!
- Pumpkaboo!

295
00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.800
- Cha.
- Noibat, bat.

296
00:15:25.866 --> 00:15:27.800
Huh?

297
00:15:27.866 --> 00:15:29.766
Ha!

298
00:15:31.066 --> 00:15:32.866
Inkay! Inkay!

299
00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:40.100
- Pumpkaboo, pum.
- Inkay, Inkay, ink.

300
00:15:40.166 --> 00:15:42.100
- Perfect.
- Nice work.

301
00:15:43.733 --> 00:15:47.100
Great. So we go in there and get them out.

302
00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:49.833
You two can stay outside and stand guard.

303
00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.133
Good idea. We'll chase them out quicker

304
00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.966
than you can say double-twerp Pokémon ambush.

305
00:15:55.033 --> 00:15:57.233
That's when you grab them. Understand?

306
00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.800
- Pumpkaboo.
- Inkay, ink.

307
00:15:58.866 --> 00:16:00.666
That plan is top-notch.

308
00:16:03.866 --> 00:16:05.666
Fletchinder.

309
00:16:05.733 --> 00:16:08.133
Hey, it's pitch black in here.

310
00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.033
Watch where you're planting your feet.

311
00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:11.666
Pokémon troublemakers.

312
00:16:11.733 --> 00:16:14.666
Hey, Hawlucha. Come out right now!

313
00:16:14.733 --> 00:16:18.366
Let's go. A real fight. Unfair and square.

314
00:16:18.433 --> 00:16:20.900
- Hawlucha. Ha?
- Noi, Noibat.

315
00:16:25.633 --> 00:16:27.366
Show your foolish face.

316
00:16:27.433 --> 00:16:29.900
Cowering is for cowards, you know.

317
00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.900
And make it snappy.

318
00:16:33.966 --> 00:16:37.633
- Noibat. Hm.
- Ha, hacha?

319
00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.400
No!

320
00:16:42.466 --> 00:16:45.400
What in the world was that? Huh?

321
00:16:45.466 --> 00:16:47.900
All right. What's the big idea?

322
00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:52.400
- I swear I didn't do anything.
- Yeah, I'm clean too.

323
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:56.066
Oh yeah? Who else could have done it? 'Fess up.

324
00:16:56.133 --> 00:16:58.400
I'm innocent, I tell you.

325
00:16:58.466 --> 00:17:00.466
- Noibat. Noi.
- Lucha.

326
00:17:00.533 --> 00:17:02.966
Ugh, this isn't logical.

327
00:17:03.033 --> 00:17:04.966
Waah!

328
00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:09.133
- What?
- You just struck me in retaliation.

329
00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.966
That wasn't me. Maybe it was Meowth.

330
00:17:12.033 --> 00:17:13.500
I'm not that stupid.

331
00:17:13.566 --> 00:17:15.700
- Bat, bat, noi.
- Cha, ha-cha.

332
00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.000
Noibat!

333
00:17:30.066 --> 00:17:32.333
- Inkay.
- Pumpkaboo.

334
00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.500
- In...
- Pump...

335
00:17:37.566 --> 00:17:39.033
- Kay!
- Ka!

336
00:17:40.166 --> 00:17:42.100
- Inkay, Inkay, Inkay!
- Pumpka, pumpka!

337
00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:47.333
- That was uncalled for.
- We're on the same team.

338
00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.433
- Pumpkaboo. Pumpkaboo.
- Inkay, Inkay, Inkay.

339
00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.833
-Fletchin, fletch.

340
00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.800
- Team Rocket.
- Fletchinder, fletch.

341
00:17:54.866 --> 00:17:57.300
Give back Hawlucha and Noibat.

342
00:17:57.366 --> 00:17:59.900
Even if we wanted to, we don't know where they are.

343
00:17:59.966 --> 00:18:03.166
- Just more of your lies.
- They're getting old.

344
00:18:03.233 --> 00:18:06.133
You're getting dumb. Quick, Pumpkaboo, use Dark Pulse.

345
00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.633
Kaboo!

346
00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.866
Dodge it! Ugh. Frogadier, I choose you.

347
00:18:13.733 --> 00:18:17.800
- Froga. Gadier!
- Now. Inkay, Psybeam.

348
00:18:17.866 --> 00:18:20.733
Inkay! -Dodge it.

349
00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.533
- Froga!
- Use Water Pulse.

350
00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:25.000
- Gadier!
- Inkay!

351
00:18:25.066 --> 00:18:27.600
- Use Aerial Ace.
- Dier.

352
00:18:28.166 --> 00:18:30.133
- Inkay!
- Frog.

353
00:18:31.166 --> 00:18:34.066
All right, Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go.

354
00:18:34.133 --> 00:18:36.100
Pikachu!

355
00:18:39.633 --> 00:18:43.800
It's ironic that Noibat can't fly but it's no problem for us.

356
00:18:43.866 --> 00:18:46.766
Perhaps we should teach a course and charge for it.

357
00:18:46.833 --> 00:18:49.566
Meowth always has the best ideas.

358
00:18:49.633 --> 00:18:52.533
We're blasting off again!

359
00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.600
- Pumpkaboo!
- Inkay!

360
00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.133
- Hawlucha.
- Noi, Noibat.

361
00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.600
Wow, it's Hawlucha and Noibat. Are you two OK?

362
00:19:04.666 --> 00:19:06.833
- Noibat.
- Hawlucha.

363
00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:09.500
Thanks for looking after Noibat, Hawlucha.

364
00:19:09.566 --> 00:19:11.366
Cha.

365
00:19:16.433 --> 00:19:20.366
Noi, noi, noi... Noi!

366
00:19:20.433 --> 00:19:23.766
- Now, have you had enough to eat?
- Noibat.

367
00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:25.366
Great.

368
00:19:25.433 --> 00:19:29.866
- So, shall we be getting on our way?
- Yeah, let's go.

369
00:19:29.933 --> 00:19:33.366
Noibat? What are you gonna do?

370
00:19:33.433 --> 00:19:35.233
Noibat, noi.

371
00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:38.033
I know. Maybe you can come along with us.

372
00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:41.033
Noi! Noibat!

373
00:19:41.166 --> 00:19:42.166
Bat, bat, bat! Noibat!

374
00:19:42.233 --> 00:19:45.666
I knew Noibat thought you were its caregiver all along.

375
00:19:45.733 --> 00:19:46.933
Lucky.

376
00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.433
- Pikachu!
- Lucha!

377
00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.333
Yup. Glad you're here.

378
00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.733
Noi.

379
00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:08.033
- Yeah! I caught a Noibat!
- Pi, Pikachu!

380
00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.933
- Yay, Noibat!
- Denne-ne!

381
00:20:10.733 --> 00:20:13.200
All right, come on out.

382
00:20:13.266 --> 00:20:16.766
Noibat! Noibat, bat, bat, bat! Noi!

383
00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:21.466
You know, I bet if we all put our heads together, we can teach it to fly.

384
00:20:21.533 --> 00:20:24.266
- Bet you're right.
- Pika.

385
00:20:24.333 --> 00:20:26.466
- Bat, bat.
- Chalu, cha-ha.

386
00:20:26.533 --> 00:20:28.666
- Ha!
- Bat, bat,bat, noi!

387
00:20:28.733 --> 00:20:32.166
Hey, Hawlucha, keep an eye on Noibat, OK?

388
00:20:32.233 --> 00:20:34.033
- Hawlucha. Aah!
- Bat, bat, bat. Aah!

389
00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.266
A Pokémon egg has wondrously hatched.

390
00:20:37.333 --> 00:20:39.966
Noibat has now joined our heroes on their journey,

391
00:20:40.033 --> 00:20:43.966
along with dreams of someday flying the great blue skies,

392
00:20:44.033 --> 00:20:46.400
as the journey continues.
